Intellectual Property

We rely on certain intellectual property rights, including patents, copyrights, trademarks and trade secrets, as well as contractual protections to establish and protect our proprietary rights with respect to employees, contractors, customers and partners.

We have certain registrations (and applications for registration) for intellectual property rights. As of December 31, 2025, we held 14 granted U.S. patents and had 21 pending U.S. patent applications. As of December 31, 2025, we held two U.S. trademarks, had two pending U.S. trademarks and held six domain names in U.S. and foreign jurisdictions. The existence of a pending application is not an assurance that it will issue or lead to a registration.

